  "content": "# 第27题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n27. What can we learn from this passage?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Practice makes perfect.\n\nB. B. Patience is a cure of anxiety.\n\nC. C. Action is worry’s worst enemy.\n\nD. D. Everything comes to those who wait.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "D",
  "analysis": "本题考查虚拟语气。与现在事实相反，if从句用一般过去时，be动词用were，主句用would+动词原形。故选D。"
